Nested styles and multi-paragraph nested lists retain semantic structure.
-- input.html --
<h1>TOOL</h1>
<h2>OPTIONS</h2>
<p>Use <strong>bold <em>both <code>mono</code></em></strong> text and <small>small <b>bold</b></small>.</p>
<dl><dt><b>--flag</b></dt><dd><p>First paragraph.</p><p>Second paragraph.</p><ul><li>Nested <em>item</em></li><li>Another</li></ul><p>After list.</p></dd></dl>
<ol start="3"><li>Three</li><li>Four</li></ol>
<h3>LINKS</h3><p><a href="mailto:help@example.com">Mail</a> or <a href="https://example.com/">web</a>.</p>
